<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>SO TOXIC!</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">angst!</ttm:agent><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v2">SUPXR</ttm:agent><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v3">prodkaz</ttm:agent><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v4">QKReign</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">SO TOXIC!</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">357uh7uNqcXDreqzoknhft</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.006" end="00:13.636">Gon</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:13.636" end="00:16.252">Baby, I don't feel so good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.252" end="00:20.543">Maybe its the drugs, maybe its the love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.543" end="00:23.116">I would change it up if I could</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.116" end="00:26.870">Only if I could, I think that I should (Gon)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.870" end="00:30.470">I think maybe you're not good for me, you're breaking my heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.470" end="00:34.009">Know you're toxic, so toxic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.009" end="00:37.319">I think maybe you're not good for me, you're breaking my heart</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:37.319" end="00:40.101">Oh you're toxic, so toxic</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.101" end="00:41.601">Kaz d-don't do it</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:41.052" end="00:44.615">There ain't no realer girl, don't care what you got on me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:44.615" end="00:47.970">Won't **** with a bitch like her, can't **** it up with this one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.970" end="00:51.503">Won't **** with a bitch like her, can't **** it up with this one, no</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.503" end="00:56.452">Won't **** with a bitch like her, can't **** it up with this one</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.452" end="01:00.119">Girl, why you so—, girl, why you so—</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.119" end="01:03.293">Girl, why you so—, girl, why you—</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.293" end="01:06.744">Girl, why you so—, girl, why you so—</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.744" end="01:08.490">Girl, why you so—, girl, why you so—</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:08.490" end="01:11.164">Baby, I don't feel so good</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.164" end="01:15.372">Maybe its the drugs, maybe its the love</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.372" end="01:17.973">I would change it up if I could</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.973" end="01:20.739">Only if I could, I think that I shou—</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.739" end="01:22.239">S-U-P-X-R</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.065" end="01:25.657">Huh, I'm feeling toxic, mad 'cause I don't drop shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.657" end="01:29.039">Showing different options, look, she still gon' pop shit</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.039" end="01:32.439">If I had to tell the truth, your songs make me nauseous</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:32.439" end="01:36.162">You're not tryna be apart, I'm just being cautious</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:36.162" end="01:38.373">Nah, say it to my face, huh</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.373" end="01:41.350">He was talking down, so we didn't leave a trace</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:41.350" end="01:43.189">King and queen got different crowns</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:43.189" end="01:44.853">But you barely know my name</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.853" end="01:46.597">Haven't seen a different town</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.597" end="01:51.368">Yeah, of course I'll win this race (So toxi-ic)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:51.368" end="01:54.779">Girl, why you so—, girl, why you so—</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.779" end="01:58.453">Girl, why you so—, girl, why you—</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.453" end="02:01.541">Girl, why you so—, girl, why you so—</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:01.541" end="02:03.312">Girl, why you so—, girl, why you so—</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.312" end="02:05.114">See what I'm saying when I'm turning all the lights off</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:05.114" end="02:06.644">Whole lotta games that I end up winning</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:06.644" end="02:08.327">Need a little change, now, I ruined your life?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:08.327" end="02:10.172">Yeah, all the more stories till the end of my life</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:10.172" end="02:11.782">If it weren't for me, would it change your life?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:11.782" end="02:13.736">You run to me like it's alright</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:13.736" end="02:15.236">Alright, you're with me</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:14.990" end="02:22.990">Bitch, your eyes, they can't see, but—</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:29.176" end="02:33.176">Gon</p></div></body></tt>